              "standard": "CraAnnex",
              "id": "Annex II (7)",
              "help_uri": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj/eng"
            }
          ],
          "remediation": "Declare when security updates end (Art. 13(8) / 13(19)): set supportEndDate in the CRA sidecar, or record the date in the SBOM. Components the end-of-life data marks as no longer supported need upgrading or replacing. CycloneDX: add a metadata.component.properties[] entry named end-of-support whose value is the date (RFC 3339 or YYYY-MM-DD).",
          "help_uri": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj/eng"
        },
        {
          "severity": "Warning",
          "category": "ComponentIdentification",
          "message": "[CRA Annex I Part II (1)] Primary component 'acme-webapp' missing unique identifier (PURL/CPE) for cross-update traceability",
          "element": "acme-webapp",
          "component_id": "acme-webapp",
          "requirement": "CRA Annex I Part II (1): Product identifier traceability across updates",
