            {
              "standard": "Pren40000_1_3",
              "id": "PRE-7-RQ-07"
            }
          ],
          "remediation": "Give the primary product component a PURL or CPE so it can be traced across updates (Annex I Part II (1)); a SWHID or SWID alone does not satisfy this check. CycloneDX: set metadata.component.purl (or cpe).",
          "help_uri": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj/eng"
        },
        {
          "severity": "Warning",
