            {
              "standard": "Pren40000_1_3",
              "id": "RLS-2-RQ-03-RE"
            }
          ],
          "remediation": "Reference the coordinated vulnerability disclosure policy (Annex I Part II (5)) from the product component. In the CRA sidecar, coordinatedDisclosurePolicyUrl satisfies the open-source steward profile and vulnerabilityDisclosureUrl lowers the manufacturer finding to Info. CycloneDX: add a metadata.component.externalReferences[] entry of type advisories linking the policy.",
          "help_uri": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj/eng"
        },
        {
          "severity": "Info",
          "category": "SecurityInfo",
          "message": "[CRA Art. 13(8) / Annex II (7)] Consider including component lifecycle/end-of-support information",
