              "id": "Annex II (7)",
              "help_uri": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj/eng"
            }
          ],
          "remediation": "Record component lifecycle or end-of-support status (Art. 13(8) / Annex II (7)); supportEndDate in the CRA sidecar counts too. Plan replacements for components approaching end-of-life. CycloneDX: add an eol, lifecycle or end-of-support entry to components[].properties[] (or an end-of-support date to metadata.component.properties[]).",
          "help_uri": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj/eng"
